OL,3,ABelfast comedian criticised for rape
OL,4,A'joke' about assault victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Belfast comedian has been criticised
OL,7,Ffor making a rape "joke" about a woman
OL,8,Fwho had recently spoken publicly about
OL,9,Fbeing the victim of a sexual assault.
OL,11,FVittorio Angelone, who has since
OL,12,Fapologised on social media, referred to
OL,13,Fcontent creator Rebecca Goodwin in a
OL,14,Fremark about rape which he made in a
OL,15,Fpodcast episode in 2025.
OL,17,FGoodwin, who had previously reported a
OL,18,Frape to police, said it will "forever
OL,19,Flive with me that it was allowed for my
OL,20,Fname to be used as the punchline of a
OL,21,Fmalicious 'joke' about such a serious
OL,22,Fissue".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
